# Cut-to-length plate shares the coil's slab ancestry through one more transformation.
eq:HSM1 a stl:Equipment ; dcterms:identifier "HSM1" ; stl:equipmentType <code/equipment-type/HSM> .
<urn:synthetic:steel:reheating/F40> a stl:Reheating ; stl:inputPiece slab:S12600017101 ; stl:reheatingDischargeTemperature 1200.0 .
